  "title": "Self-evidencing",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "744a279d-094a-4ea1-9edb-e1a4ffc2e5aa",
      "text": "Self-evidencing names the reading of self-organization as maximizing the evidence for the model that a thing embodies. A thing that keeps its surprisal low is, in Bayesian terms, gathering evidence for its own existence.",
